NOTE FOR THE REPOSITORY OWNER — DELETE THIS SECTION BEFORE PUBLISHING

Two placeholders above must be filled in before this licence means anything:
`[Company legal name]` and `[contact@yourdomain]`. A copyright notice naming
nobody is difficult to enforce.

This text has not been reviewed by a lawyer. It is a strict all-rights-reserved
notice, which is the correct default for a commercial product, but if you plan
to take investment, hire, or accept outside contributions, have counsel review
it — particularly clause 2, which is deliberately one-sided.

Also note: making a GitHub repository public does not license it, but it does
grant other GitHub users the limited right to view and fork it within GitHub,
under the GitHub Terms of Service, regardless of what this file says. If that
is not acceptable, keep the repository private.
